sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You
    participant M as Main Agent (Main Session)
    participant E as Engine
    participant S as Market Data Source
    participant X as Executor Sessions
    participant O as Outbox
    U->>M: Monitor BABA below USD 100, with agreed research
    M->>E: Accept monitoring work through Eval
    E->>X: Assignment for monitoring Ticket
    X->>S: Configure condition and subscribe to its Thread
    Note over E,X: Each Ticket has a Mandate, Session and directory
    Note over S,X: Monitoring waits without a running model turn
    S->>E: Threshold crossed: Trigger on subscribed Thread
    E->>O: Queue authorized alert first (extension)
    E->>X: Deliver Input to monitoring Ticket
    E->>M: Assess new research candidate against Policy
    O-->>U: Threshold crossed, analysis requested
    M->>E: Accept research within the enabled rule
    E->>X: Assignment for a new research Ticket
    Note over X: Research uses its own Ticket directory and cited materials
    X->>E: Report findings and queue authorized reply
    E->>O: Queue analysis
    O->>U: Price drivers, market conditions and sentiment
    Note over E,O: Ticket end and message delivery are separate facts
